Original commit body from 5e81ead:

After processing source files by centrality, the Structure tree now also
scans for CONFIG/DOCUMENTATION files in unrepresented directories. This
ensures directories containing only docs or config files still get
representation in the tree.

Uses separate limits to prevent crowding:
- Max 5 root-level files (e.g., pyproject.toml, README.md)
- Max 10 root-level directories
- Max 5 additional files from unrepresented directories
